note What a definition does for each intent, given as the Peek the panel would show: a jump selects the symbol (or opens the line in the Source view), and a jump that started on the Graph tab also brings References. A peek keeps the definition; a definition outside the repo is kept either way and the status line says where it is. Whatever is kept as a peek brings the References view into sight (Panels::bring), so the peek is never drawn where the reader cannot see it.

